Value Statement: 

As a User, 

I want to access ROC Case listing Page 

So that, I can view the recovery case listing UI Tabs in the UTW Recoveries based on the logged in persona 

  

Process Overview: 

After SSO login and landing on the Cases page, users see main navigation tabs for the UTW Recoveries system. Access to these tabs is determined by their user persona. This structure ensures that each user accesses only the features relevant to their role. 

Main Tabs Under UTW Recoveries UI Screen: 

Cases 

Workforce Management 

Report Scheduler 

DBR Load 

Bump Data Management 

GGR Management 

Excel Communication 

External Links 

Manage Templates 

Manage Consolidated Group 

