Acceptance Criteria: 

Persona-based Tab Display 

The main navigation tabs must be visible for each user persona strictly according to the access matrix provided above. 

Tab Navigation 

Users can navigate between the UI tabs by clicking on the tab names in the top navigation section. 

Navigation between tabs occurs without requiring additional login.------------------------------- 

